Programmer in Pocket - Build Information
========================================

Build Type: Debug (Demo)
Version: 1.0.0-alpha  
Target SDK: 34 (Android 14)
Min SDK: 26 (Android 8.0)
Build Date: Fri Oct 17 23:31:23 UTC 2025

Features:
- Monaco Code Editor (WebView based)
- Python execution via Pyodide
- JavaScript execution
- Kotlin script analysis
- Project management
- Code snippets library
- Interactive learning
- Material 3 UI
- Arabic language support

Modules:
- app: Main application
- editor: Code editor module
- runtime: Code execution engine
- snippets: Code snippets library
- terminal: Terminal emulator
- projects: Project management
- auth: Authentication module

Note: This is a development build and requires a proper
Android build environment to create an installable APK.

للحصول على APK حقيقي:
1. Install Android Studio
2. Open this project
3. Run: Build -> Build APK(s)

Website: https://programmerinpocket.com
Support: support@programmerinpocket.com
